OL,3,GNEWSADriver sent to custody for
OL,4,Ainjuring pedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who knocked down a motorist
OL,7,Fwho tried to stop him from causing a
OL,8,Fcrash has been given a three-year
OL,9,Fcustodial sentence.
OL,11,FArchie Glen McCann was apparently
OL,12,Fracing other vehicles on Upton Bypass
OL,13,Fon 29 March when a concerned motorist
OL,14,Fmanaged to block the road and approach
OL,15,Fthe defendant on foot, Dorset Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FAs McCann drove off, his car hit the
OL,19,Fpedestrian causing a skull fracture, a
OL,20,Fbleed to the brain, a broken leg and
OL,21,Fpermanent deafness in one ear.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
